    },
    {
      "source": "ppt/slides/slide2.xml",
      "text": [
        "A complete brief",
        "2 min",
        "Example learning activity",
        "Starting request: “Help with my class.”",
        "For twelve new volunteer mentors, draft a three-point opening checklist for a 15-minute…",
        "The brief names the audience, task, facts to use and the output."
      ],
      "shapes": {
        "sp": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "source": "ppt/slides/slide3.xml",
      "text": [
        "Four details to check",
        "2 min",
        "Example learning activity",
        "Audience",
        "Who will use the result?",
        "Task",
        "What should the helper do?",
        "Evidence",
        "Which facts or sources should it use?",
        "Output",
        "What should the result look like?",
        "A longer request can still leave the task unclear."
      ],
      "shapes": {
        "sp": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "source": "ppt/slides/slide4.xml",
      "text": [
        "A guided revision",
        "3 min",
        "Example learning activity",
        "Eight new volunteers need a room-opening checklist. The room opens at 09:30. A supplied floor…",
        "Write the request. Use the four details to check your draft.",
        "Your revised request",
        "If stuck, begin with the person who will use the result."
      ],
      "shapes": {
        "sp": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "source": "ppt/slides/slide5.xml",
      "text": [
        "An independent brief",
        "3 min",
        "Example learning activity",
        "A repair host needs a summary of ten tool-check records. Two records lack a check date. The…",
        "Write the request. Keep the missing dates visible.",
        "Your attempt",
        "Use your own wording. Quiet individual work is welcome."
      ],
      "shapes": {
        "sp": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "source": "ppt/slides/slide6.xml",
      "text": [
        "A comparison and a retry",
        "2 min",
        "Example learning activity",
        "For the repair host, summarize the ten supplied tool-check records in three points about what…",
        "Compare the four details with your attempt. Find one useful change and revise your brief.",
        "Different wording can work. Preserve the task and supported facts."
      ],
      "shapes": {
        "sp": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "source": "ppt/slides/slide7.xml",
      "text": [
        "A later use",
        "1 min",
        "Example learning activity",
        "Choose a different task you might ask a helper to do. Which source would let the helper check…",
        "My next request is about…",
        "Use the four checks again when that situation occurs."
      ],
      "shapes": {
        "sp": 6
      }
    }
